      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/15ced063da3fc623c89cb0faea40fc4cfc0c3271",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "e06f5d76fc303c2fbcc1cd31887efaff77b71474",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/e06f5d76fc303c2fbcc1cd31887efaff77b71474"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e06f5d76fc303c2fbcc1cd31887efaff77b71474\nparent 013b0b2de48153b7481c036a353b81a411f1da8f\nauthor Rob Hamilton <6456095+Rob1Ham@users.noreply.github.com> 1786679713 +0000\ncommitter Hodlinator <172445034+hodlinator@users.noreply.github.com> 1788893337 +0200\n\nrpc: invalid credentials can occupy every HTTP worker\n\nA low-medium service-availability issue lets an admitted HTTP client hold each shared worker for 250 ms per invalid Basic credential, filling the waiting queue and delaying or rejecting authenticated RPC and REST work.\n\nRemove the worker-thread sleep while preserving authentication, warning logs, challenge responses, and timing-resistant comparison.\n",
